DEMO WORKFLOW
-------------
1. Sign in as Administrator. Create an election, add candidates, set voter
   eligibility, lock candidates, and activate the election.
2. Sign in as Alice or Bob and open the voter portal. Cast a ballot and keep the
   receipt for verification.
3. Sign in as Administrator and close the election.
4. Sign in as Authority 1 and Authority 2 and submit approvals for the tally.
5. Check published results at /results and verify the ballot receipt at /verify.
   Use Observer at /observer to inspect audit and chain integrity.

Each friend running the project uses their own local database and their own
local Ganache chain. They cannot access your computer's localhost unless you set
up separate LAN networking; no internet-hosted demo is started by these steps.
